Source package notes
====================

This source builds the experimental userspace CLI and separately licensed
Linux AF_ALG Merkle tool, not the Yocto kernel BLAKE3 provider.
No kernel DKMS module or Secure Boot integration is shipped.

Debian source includes GPL-2.0-only, MIT and CC0-1.0 components.
Files and THIRD_PARTY.md require final upstream rightsholder verification.
The GitHub no-reply email is a build-only placeholder: replace it with
a monitored public maintainer address before soliciting Debian sponsors.
A separate upstream release tag and working debian/watch are also needed.
